summary: Verifies that vfree() doesn't trigger NMI watchdog BUG when freeing a large vmalloc'd area.
description: |
        Verifies that vfree() doesn't trigger NMI watchdog BUG when freeing a large vmalloc'd area.
contact: mm-qe <mm-qe@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
